 "Versions of the Smile Prompt Language, from Earlier Languages to v0.3, v0.4, v1.0 and Definitions",
 :description
 "How the Smile Prompt Language has been versioned, from the earlier prompt languages before it and v0.3 and v0.4 in 2025, through version 1.0 and the version control of prompts, to versions as definitions and ontologies in 2026, in my own words with every source.",
 :keywords
 "Smile prompt language versions, Smile v0.3, Smile v0.4, Smile v1.0, prompt version control, Hybrid Smile, Strict Smile, Dense Smile, history of Smile",
